  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Traben-0/Entity_Model_Features/blob/master/src/main/resources/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"150\"><br></p><h1>實體模型功能</h1><hr><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252frURmwrzUcz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vU8pcbf.png\" alt=\"discord\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yZzzW4Q.pngg\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-model-features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rpoyjVG.png\" alt=\"curseforge\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VgKekoJ.png\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentity-model-features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7fioiRx.png\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tiNmDIH.png\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"https://github.com/Traben-0/Entity_Model_Features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EYNx6oL.png\" alt=\"github\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yar5K6v.png\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ftraben\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xdhWKwC.png\" alt=\"kofi\"></a></p><hr><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/4I1XuqiY/images/49f5b98dfef5b073a3971750673d343e1f92efe5.png\" width=\"550\"><br></p><hr><h1>關於</h1><p>實體模型功能（EMF）是一款 Fabric、Forge 和 NeoForge 的模組，可支援 OptiFine 的自訂實體模型（CEM）。</p><p>專為希望使用 CEM 資源包功能，同時也想使用 OptiFine 替代模組（如 Sodium、Continuity 或 ETF）的玩家設計。</p><h1>必要模組</h1><p>如果可能，請一併安裝以下模組。至於 Sodium 等明顯的模組則不再贅述。</p><p>此外，必須特別說明 EMF 與 dorianpb 的 CEM 以及 OptiFine / OptiFabric 不相容。</p><h4>必要</h4><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentitytexturefeatures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">實體紋理功能（ETF）</a>：EMF 使用了我的另一個模組 ETF 的多項功能，因此為必裝。（主要用於支援隨機模型功能、設定介面，以及讓模型中設定的紋理能像 OptiFine 一樣變化）</li>\n</ul><h4>強烈推薦</h4><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentityculling\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">實體剔除（Entity Culling）</a>：此模組能大幅減少實體渲染的延遲，效果甚至比 Sodium 內建的實體剔除更強大。對於使用 Fresh Animations 等大量動畫的資源包來說非常有益。</li>\n</ul><h1>Fresh Animations？</h1><p>是的。</p><p>它是可以運作的 :)</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/4I1XuqiY/images/2f32dbeadc25e46ef6c56f0e47e5eb5d305c8ea2.png\" width=\"450\"><br></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252ftexture-pack%252ffresh-animations-v1-0%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">下載 Fresh Animations</a></p><h1>功能特性、與 OptiFine 的差異及已知問題</h1><p>最新功能詳細說明頁面：<a href=\"https://github.com/Traben-0/Entity_Model_Features/blob/master/FEATURES.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">功能特性與 Optifine 差異</a></p><hr><h1>更新日誌</h1><p>您可以在<a href=\"https://github.com/Traben-0/Entity_Model_Features/blob/master/changelog.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>找到更新日誌。</p><hr><h1>需要幫助或有疑問？</h1><p>您可以透過我的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252frURmwrzUcz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a>（首選）或是在 <a href=\"https://github.com/Traben-0/Entity_Model_Features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> 上提出問題。</p><hr><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252frURmwrzUcz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vU8pcbf.png\" alt=\"discord\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yZzzW4Q.pngg\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-model-features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rpoyjVG.png\" alt=\"curseforge\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VgKekoJ.png\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentity-model-features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7fioiRx.png\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tiNmDIH.png\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"https://github.com/Traben-0/Entity_Model_Features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EYNx6oL.png\" alt=\"github\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yar5K6v.png\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ftraben\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xdhWKwC.png\" alt=\"kofi\"></a></p><hr><h2>主機合作夥伴優惠</h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.kinetichosting.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d641\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/BVzZfTc1/images/bfb592538f8206a6a2d72d19c90714bea91b0e07.png\" alt=\"image\"></a></p>",
